REGENT OF DONGGALA

CENTRAL SULAWESI PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF DONGGALA REGENCY

NUMBER 5 OF 2014

CONCERNING

PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF DONGGALA,

a. that women and children are creations of Almighty God who constitute important elements of Indonesian society and nation;

b. that Indonesian women have an important role in community activities, development and family life and have the obligation to nurture, protect and raise Indonesian children to grow and develop as the nation's future generation;

c. that Indonesian children are Indonesian human resources who will later become actors in all fields of social and state life;
d. that in social life, women and children in Donggala Regency often experience violence or unpleasant treatment so it is considered important to protect them;
e. based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, letter c, and letter d, a Regional Regulation of Donggala Regency concerning Protection for Women and Children is established.

